"""Hand-written copy for the daily story reels.

Every verse text shown on screen is an exact excerpt of the Diyanet Vakfı translation
(alquran.cloud tr.vakfi). daily.py checks each excerpt against the full translation and
skips any entry that does not match, so a typo here can never put altered words on screen.
Dua texts come from the app's own dua.json (by id).

Fields
  ref     "surah:ayah"
  hook    opening line (a question or a short setup, never a claim about the verse)
  ex      exact excerpt of the translation shown on screen
  hl      part of `ex` drawn in gold
  note    one or two calm lines after the verse
  cta     amin | share | save | salavat | hamd | <custom text>
"""

